    "text": "The ratio of mass percent of C and H of an organic compound  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  is 6 : 1. If one molecule of the above compound  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>  contains half as much oxygen as required to burn one molecule of compound  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub></math>  completely to  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  and  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> . The empirical formula of compound   <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></msub></math>  is",
