  "solution": {
    "text": "Ratio of mass % of C and H in  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></msub></math>  is 6 : 1.<br/><br/>Therefore, Ratio of mole % of C and H in  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></msub></math>  will be 1 : 2.<br/><br/>Therefore x : y = 1 : 2, which is possible in options 1,  2 and 3. <br/><br/>Now oxygen required to burn  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/>Now z is half of oxygen atoms required to burn  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>So  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>Now putting values of x and y from the given options<br/><br/>Option A,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br/><br/>Option B,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4.5</mn></math> <br/><br/>Therefore correct option is 1  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>",
